535   8328              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
536   8328              ; Port EF text logger (ASCII bytes, same convention as Project112).
537   8328              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
538   8328              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
539   8328              ; Spectrum display and keyboard control.
540   8328              ; RST 10h is the Spectrum ROM PRINT-OUT entry (current channel #2).
541   8328              ; SPACE is bit 0 of keyboard row 7FFE, active low.
